    "instructions": "ORCHESTRATED STAGE 4 — The program owns coverage, tool authorization, source binding, and input accounting. Call the only currently exposed tool. First freeze the plan. After each inspect_stage4_visual_job call, record its factual observation with record_visual_job_note before another image job becomes available. After all visual jobs, record_visual_finding_batch asks only which routed inputs were actually acquired; the program automatically binds every relevant bundle and marks the other routed visual inputs unresolved. Do not describe compliance. Run every registered measurement job exactly once through run_registered_measurement, using inspected endpoint observations only when the job requires endpoints, then persist all completed measurement outcomes with record_measurement_finding_batch. Direct Stage 3 inputs and inputs blocked by the frozen measurement spec are materialized automatically. Call get_stage4_readiness; if ready is false, complete only the listed gaps and call readiness again. Call seal_measurements only after ready is true. Never invent source IDs, evidence kinds, tools_used, measurement tools, or acquisition attempts. THIS TEST MUST STOP IMMEDIATELY AFTER Stage 4 is sealed; no Stage 5 call is permitted.",
